  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 38948bbc0f96de7498bb32b64efae4ec, type: 3}
  m_Name: Pilote -Mail Promotion
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  title: Promotions day!
  character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8db74389b8c31914dbe8c9c4cf3c818b, type: 2}
  mailText: 'Good morning,


    We are pleased to inform you that you''ve been allowed
    to grant promotions to employees. You don''t have to, but if you feel that any
    of your employees deserve it, now is the time to reward them!


    However,
    only those who took less than 30min of consecutive breaks and hold at least three
    A''s and no E''s at their H.E.A.L.T.H. score are eligible.


    P.S. Try not
    to go overboard in granting the promotions! '
